m]through guarded, recoverable note writes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_status_groups.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/task_status_groups.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-1y[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-1y/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Protect task-status-hooks writes against concurrent vault [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]edits[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]guarded_writes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarded_writes: route existing hook writes through snapshot validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared maintenance locking, staged replacement, recovery records, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accurate failure outcomes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Implement a lossless Markdown status-group transformation[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]status_group_transform[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]status_group_transform: preserve task subtrees and authored topic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]context while producing stable status headings, source-aware change [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records, and conservative skip diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrate grouping, reporting, compatibility, and acceptance [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]integrate_status_groups[dim] · [dim][/dim]after guarded_writes, status_group_transform[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integrate_status_groups: compose grouping after final status derivation,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enable guarded structural writes, expose clear reports, and verify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture and collection compatibility.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1y","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1y.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f775f0c7777e0a26fedfe1fee801764d","started_at":"2026-09-10T15:34:05.714609+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.land"]}
